; Like beancount v3's CAPITAL token, a capital letter before whitespace is
; a currency or a flag, of a transaction or a posting.
2020-01-01 open Assets:A
2020-01-01 open Assets:B
2020-01-02 * "x"
  Assets:A  1 V
  Assets:B
2020-01-02 commodity V
  quote: P
2020-01-03 V "flag"
  Assets:A  1 USD
  Assets:B
2020-01-04 * "posting flags"
  P Assets:A  1 USD
  V Assets:A  1 P
  & Assets:B  -1 USD
  # Assets:B
2020-01-05 price V 1 P
2020-01-06 open Assets:C V
2020-01-07 * "cost"
  Assets:C  1 V {1 P }
  Assets:B
2020-01-08 * "price"
  Assets:A  1 V @ 1 P
  Assets:B
2020-01-09 balance Assets:C 1 V
2020-01-09 P "p flag"
  Assets:A  1 USD
  Assets:B
